{
  "Document": [
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": 1,
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "The Tauri Backend Overview"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "The Tauri backend is where the \"heavy lifting\" of your application happens. Unlike the frontend, which is restricted by the browser's sandbox, the backend is a native Rust process with full access to the operating system."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": 2,
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "Role of the Backend"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "The backend serves several critical purposes:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "UnorderedList": [
        [
          {
            "Paragraph": [
              {
                "Text": "**OS Interop**: Talking to the filesystem, network, and hardware."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Paragraph": [
              {
                "Text": "**Performance**: Running computationally expensive tasks that would freeze the UI."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Paragraph": [
              {
                "Text": "**Security**: Managing sensitive data and API keys that should never be exposed to the frontend."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Paragraph": [
              {
                "Text": "**Lifecycle**: Controlling when the app starts, minimizes, or closes."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": 2,
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "The Rust Ecosystem"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "Because the backend is standard Rust, you can use any crate from "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "crates.io"
        },
        {
          "Text": ". Whether you need a database like "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "sqlx"
        },
        {
          "Text": ", a networking library like "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "reqwest"
        },
        {
          "Text": ", or a serialization tool like "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "serde"
        },
        {
          "Text": ", you have the full power of the Rust ecosystem at your disposal."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}